[Substrike]
format=1
name=Tight Notch
category=Hardstyle
author=Substrike
tags=hardstyle, tight, notch, measured
description=A short hardstyle kick fitted to tight tails of about 400 ms, for fast patterns: overdriven, clipped, notched on the second harmonic and bright. The cut follows the keys; root C2, tail on F1.
